ice"},{"text":").","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"While the split transform is installed, the host view’s frame is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"transformed bounding box, so each pass applies the layout fraction to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"picture a SECOND time — the content renders at fraction² of its box — and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"drifts the picture out of the frozen content mask, exposing black regions","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"inside the box. react-native-video is immune: its layout stamps sublayers","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from ","type":"text"},{"code":"bounds","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which a transform never changes.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The lock captures the healthy pre-transform frame at acquisition and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"re-asserts it (through the host’s own frame API, via ","type":"text"},{"code":"restamp","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") whenever","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the surface’s layer geometry deviates. Observed on the LAYER: UIView","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"geometry setters are not KVO-compliant, CALayer’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"bounds","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"code":"position","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"— the same technique as the overlay host view’s host-layer observers.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Construct on the main thread (it reads and may re-stamp view geometry);","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"release","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" only invalidates the observations and is safe from any thread.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime\/contentlayoutlock"],"